        <li><a href={SRC.toRep} rel="noopener">City of Toronto — energy and water reporting for buildings</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.beps} rel="noopener">City of Toronto — Building Emissions Performance Standards</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.council} rel="noopener">Toronto City Council — item 2025.IE26.3 (December 16–17, 2025)</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.enb} rel="noopener">Enbridge Gas — commercial audits and studies</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.epp} rel="noopener">Save on Energy — Energy Performance Program</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.ebcx} rel="noopener">Save on Energy — Existing Building Commissioning program</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.eem} rel="noopener">Save on Energy — Expanded Energy Management Program</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.retrofit} rel="noopener">Save on Energy — Retrofit Program</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.biz} rel="noopener">Save on Energy — BizEnergySaver (all of Toronto since July 23, 2026)</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.erl} rel="noopener">City of Toronto — Energy Retrofit Loans</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.hiris} rel="noopener">City of Toronto — Hi-RIS apartment retrofit loans</a></li>
        <li><a href={SRC.btu} rel="noopener">City of Toronto — Building Tune-Up Program</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="small mb-0">Checked against these pages on {VERIFIED}. Programs change — confirm on the official page before you spend.</p>
    </div>

    <LeadForm heading="Need a building audit or a home assessment in Toronto?" sub="Tell us whether it's a home or a building — we'll point you to the right kind of professional, matched to your area." region="toronto" context="article-toronto-services" />
  </div>
</Base>

